    "takeawayZh": "装 @pixkit/react，拿像素风按钮与配套 token",
    "noteZh": "README 第一行是 PixKit 🎮，接着一句 A pixel-art themed UI component library for React and React Native, built with TypeScript and modern design tokens。小节按 🌐 Live Demo（https://shayaqhmetov.github.io/pixkit/）、📦 Packages、🚀 Installation、📖 Usage、🎨 Components、🛠️ Development、📝 License 排开，Packages 一段说明 @pixkit/react 带网页 CSS、@pixkit/native 是 React Native 组件、@pixkit/tokens 放颜色与间距这些 token。仓库根目录是 pnpm-workspace.yaml、turbo.json、.changeset 那套 monorepo 结构，packages 的提交信息写着 add canonical qurbaqa theme tokens and themed native kit，Contributors 三人里除了作者还有一个 claude。",
